WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.034 line:0%
- HELLO,
EVERYBODY OUT THERE.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:04.136 line:0%
THIS IS BROCK FAVORS
WITH TRAFFIC ON THE ONES.

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:05.905 line:0%
CHAD ARMSTRONG
IS OUT SICK TODAY,

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.541 line:0%
SO I AM FILLING IN
FROM MY USUAL LAND REPORTS.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.843 line:0%
AND, UH, I'M UP HERE
IN THE CHOPPER.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:13.847 line:0%
BUT I GOTTA TELL YOU GUYS,
I AM LOVING THE VIEW.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:16.115 line:0%
[laughs]
OH, [bleep]!

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.550 line:0%
[screams]
OH, MY GOD!

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.119 line:0%
OH, OH, NO!
STOP, STOP, STOP, STOP.

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:23.523 line:0%
OH!

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.224 line:0%
WHEW.

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.093 line:0%
ALL RIGHT.
[chuckles]

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.295 line:0%
WELL, WE ARE,
UM, UH--

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.830 line:0%
WE ARE OVER THE 10.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.731 line:0%
IT IS MASSIVELY CLOGGED
DOWN THERE,

00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:35.735 line:0%
LIKE A PINT OF MAPLE SYRUP
ON A COOL NOVEMBER MORNING.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.471 line:0%
AND WE JUST--OH, [bleep]!
MOTHER-[bleep], GOD DAMN!

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.207 line:0%
WE GON' DIE
IN THIS MOTHER-[bleep]!

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.743 line:0%
OH, [bleep].
OH, [bleep].

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.445 line:0%
OH, MY GOD!

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:51.317 line:0%
WHEW, WHEW, WHEW!

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.152 line:0%
OKAY.
[chuckles]

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:56.923 line:0%
OKAY, I AM, UH--
I AM VERY SORRY, FOLKS.

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.125 line:0%
[chuckles] IT'S A LITTLE BIT
OF A BUMPY RIDE UP HERE.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.928 line:0%
WE ARE NOW APPROACHING
THE 405,

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:06.266 line:0%
AH, WHERE THE LEFT LANE
IS BLOCKED BY A MATTRESS.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.367 line:0%
SO SOMEBODY IS,
UH, GONNA BE DOING

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:11.236 line:0%
A LITTLE RETURN TO IKEA LATER
TODAY, YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAY--

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:14.673 line:0%
OH, NO, [bleep], PLEASE!
[bleep]. OH, GOD DAMN!

00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:16.743 line:0%
OH, GET ME OUT THIS
MOTHER-[bleep] DEATH MACHINE

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.377 line:0%
RIGHT NOW!
OH, NO!

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:20.380 line:0%
BLACK PEOPLE AIN'T MEANT
TO BE IN THE SKY!

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.515 line:0%
WE AIN'T MEANT TO BE
IN THE SKY, MAN.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:26.286 line:0%
[crying]
OH, MAMA, HELP ME.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.354 line:0%
MOTHER-[bleep].

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:31.924 line:0%
OH, MAMA!
AAH, [bleep].

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:35.028 line:0%
WELL, THE 405 IS [bleep] UP
RIGHT NOW.

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:38.230 line:0%
AIN'T NOBODY GOING DOWN
THIS [bleep]. I'M SORRY.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:44.070 line:0%
I'M SORRY.
I'M VERY SORRY, FOLKS.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.438 line:0%
I'M VERY SORRY
ABOUT THAT,

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.307 line:0%
BUT I AM LOSING
MY [bleep] UP HERE.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.842
- ACTUALLY,
YOU HAVE EVERY RIGHT TO.

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:51.277
WE'RE ABOUT TO CRASH.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:52.578
- OH, [bleep],
HELP ME.

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.046
[bleep].
OH, MY GOD, HELP.

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:58.217
MAMA, PLEASE.
MAMA! HELP!

00:01:58.317 --> 00:01:59.819
[explosion]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.489 line:0%
[upbeat music]

